","other_name_zh":"分组查询注意力","other_occurred_at":null,"other_slug":"grouped-query-attention","other_summary":"让多组查询头共享键值头以缩小 KV 缓存的注意力变体。","rationale":"都为缩小 KV 缓存而设计，一个共享头，一个压缩到潜在空间。","sources":[{"quote":null,"title":"DeepSeek-V2: A Strong, Economical, and Efficient Mixture-of-Experts Language Model","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2405.04434"}],"type":"alternative_to","valid_from":null,"valid_to":null},{"confidence":0.9,"created_at":"2026-10-21T07:49:49.124827+00:00","dir":"out","id":"e_01m5eq05qcafjxg5b5","other_id":"n_01m5eh84st7wpena8e","other_kind":"organization","other_layer":"knowledge","other_name":"DeepSeek","other_name_zh":"深度求索","other_occurred_at":null,"other_slug":"deepseek","other_summary":"以高效训练和开放权重模型著称的中国人工智能公司。","rationale":"MLA 由 DeepSeek 在 DeepSeek-V2 中提出。","sources":[{"quote":null,"title":"DeepSeek-V2: A Strong, Economical, and Efficient Mixture-of-Experts Language Model","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2405.04434"}],"type":"developed_by","valid_from":null,"valid_to":null},{"confidence":0.95,"created_at":"2026-10-21T07:49:49.124827+00:00","dir":"in","id":"e_01m5eq05qpxngpy81w","other_id":"n_01m5eq05hrmk3tge1g","other_kind":"model","other_layer":"knowledge","other_name":"DeepSeek-V3","other_name_zh":null,"other_occurred_at":null,"other_slug":"deepseek-v3","other_summary":"DeepSeek 发布的 6710 亿总参数、每词元激活 370 亿参数的开放权重 MoE 模型。","rationale":"DeepSeek-V3 采用多头潜在注意力。","sources":[{"quote":null,"title":"DeepSeek-V3 Technical Report","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2412.19437"}],"type":"uses","valid_from":null,"valid_to":null}],"sources":[{"field":null,"published_at":"2024-05-07","publisher":"arXiv","quote":null,"title":"DeepSeek-V2: A Strong, Economical, and Efficient Mixture-of-Experts Language Model","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2405.04434"}],"topics":[{"id":"n_01m5eh84sra3k1vqv7","name":"Efficient Inference and Serving","name_zh":"高效推理与部署","slug":"efficient-inference-and-serving"},{"id":"n_01m5eh84sr9t72dp1f","name":"Model Architecture","name_zh":"模型架构","slug":"mod